# OpenCart Automation Framework

## Project Overview

This project is a Selenium Automation Framework developed for testing the OpenCart E-Commerce application.

The framework is built using:

* Java
* Selenium WebDriver
* TestNG
* Maven
* Page Object Model (POM)
* Data-Driven Testing
* Extent Reports
* Jenkins CI/CD Integration
* Cross Browser Testing

The framework automates critical user workflows and generates detailed execution reports.

